{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781406867167,"sessionID":"ses_13be158d9ffe0TX7Zn2IXZl4Ah","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_ShgLtizopqniJ5E4OvmezQGL","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/expense_decisions.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/expense_decisions.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ## Checkpoint 2: Item-Level Audit Decisions\n2: \n3: | Expense ID | Claimed Amount | Approved Amount | Non-Reimbursable Amount | Status | Policy / Receipt Reason |\n4: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n5: | T-001 | $480.00 | $480.00 | $0.00 | approved | Receipt present. Economy airfare is reimbursable with a receipt. |\n6: | T-002 | $45.00 | $0.00 | $45.00 | rejected | Receipt present, but optional seat upgrade is not reimbursable without written preapproval. No preapproval was included. |\n7: | T-003 | $510.00 | $440.00 | $70.00 | partial | Receipt present. Lodging cap is $220.00 per covered night x 2 nights = $440.00 maximum reimbursable. |\n8: | T-004 | $76.00 | $58.00 | $18.00 | partial | Receipt present. Meal receipt includes $18.00 of wine, and alcohol is not reimbursable. Remaining food subtotal of $58.00 is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |\n9: | T-005 | $70.00 | $60.00 | $10.00 | partial | Receipt present. Ride-share base fare of $50.00 is reimbursable. Tip is capped at 20% of base fare, so only $10.00 of the $20.00 tip is reimbursable. |\n10: | T-006 | $82.00 | $0.00 | $82.00 | rejected | No receipt provided. Expenses of $75.00 or more require receipts, and supplies are reimbursable only when the required receipt is provided and business purpose is clear. |\n11: | T-007 | $18.00 | $18.00 | $0.00 | approved | Receipt present. Breakfast is a reimbursable meal expense and is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |\n\n(End of file - total 11 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"## Checkpoint 2: Item-Level Audit Decisions\n\n| Expense ID | Claimed Amount | Approved Amount | Non-Reimbursable Amount | Status | Policy / Receipt Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n| T-001 | $480.00 | $480.00 | $0.00 | approved | Receipt present. Economy airfare is reimbursable with a receipt. |\n| T-002 | $45.00 | $0.00 | $45.00 | rejected | Receipt present, but optional seat upgrade is not reimbursable without written preapproval. No preapproval was included. |\n| T-003 | $510.00 | $440.00 | $70.00 | partial | Receipt present. Lodging cap is $220.00 per covered night x 2 nights = $440.00 maximum reimbursable. |\n| T-004 | $76.00 | $58.00 | $18.00 | partial | Receipt present. Meal receipt includes $18.00 of wine, and alcohol is not reimbursable. Remaining food subtotal of $58.00 is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |\n| T-005 | $70.00 | $60.00 | $10.00 | partial | Receipt present. Ride-share base fare of $50.00 is reimbursable. Tip is capped at 20% of base fare, so only $10.00 of the $20.00 tip is reimbursable. |\n| T-006 | $82.00 | $0.00 | $82.00 | rejected | No receipt provided. Expenses of $75.00 or more require receipts, and supplies are reimbursable only when the required receipt is provided and business purpose is clear. |\n| T-007 | $18.00 | $18.00 | $0.00 | approved | Receipt present. Breakfast is a reimbursable meal expense and is within the $65.00 daily meal cap. |","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/expense_decisions.md","time":{"start":1781406867143,"end":1781406867158}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0981bfd1762cfe4e016a2e1c932270819199912eff4b6fe7ef"}},"id":"prt_ec41f9ec1001vWsob37CTdV0Qo","sessionID":"ses_13be158d9ffe0TX7Zn2IXZl4Ah","messageID":"msg_ec41f8686001NvzUmKO77dkhwE"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781406867167,"sessionID":"ses_13be158d9ffe0TX7Zn2IXZl4Ah","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_wspcqvD7nXZZALYoOnvHEYxW","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/policy_application.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/policy_application.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ## Checkpoint 1: Policy Selection and Application\n2: \n3: - Trip dates audited: `2026-05-08` to `2026-05-10`.\n4: - Controlling policy source: `current_policy.md` dated `2026-04-20`.\n5: - Why it controls: the current policy is effective for trips starting on or after `2026-05-01`, this trip started on `2026-05-08`, and the current policy explicitly supersedes older travel policy excerpts when they conflict.\n6: \n7: ### Applied Rules\n8: \n9: | Topic | Applied Rule | Source |\n10: | --- | --- | --- |\n11: | Receipt threshold | Receipts are required for every expense of `$75.00` or more. | `current_policy.md` |\n12: | Seat upgrades | Seat upgrades, extra-legroom fees, priority boarding, and similar optional upgrades are not reimbursable unless written preapproval is included in the receipt evidence. | `current_policy.md` |\n13: | Lodging cap basis | Lodging is capped at `$220.00` per covered night, including room, taxes, and mandatory fees. Covered nights: `2`, so the lodging cap is `2 x $220.00 = $440.00`. | `current_policy.md` |\n14: | Meals and alcohol | Meals are reimbursable at actual cost up to `$65.00` per day. Alcohol is not reimbursable and must be removed from meal receipts before applying the daily meal rule. | `current_policy.md` |\n15: | Ride-share tips | Ride-share base fare is reimbursable with a receipt. Tips are reimbursable only up to `20%` of the base fare. | `current_policy.md` |\n16: | Supplies receipts | Work supplies are reimbursable only when a required receipt is provided and the business purpose is clear. | `current_policy.md` |\n17: \n18: ### Stale Policy Note\n19: \n20: - The stale excerpt in `stale_policy_excerpt.md` is dated `2026-03-01` and predates the current policy.\n21: - It conflicts with the current policy on the receipt threshold, lodging cap, ride-share tip cap, and seat-upgrade treatment.\n22: - Because this trip starts after the current policy effective date, the stale excerpt does not control this audit.\n\n(End of file - total 22 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"## Checkpoint 1: Policy Selection and Application\n\n- Trip dates audited: `2026-05-08` to `2026-05-10`.\n- Controlling policy source: `current_policy.md` dated `2026-04-20`.\n- Why it controls: the current policy is effective for trips starting on or after `2026-05-01`, this trip started on `2026-05-08`, and the current policy explicitly supersedes older travel policy excerpts when they conflict.\n\n### Applied Rules\n\n| Topic | Applied Rule | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Receipt threshold | Receipts are required for every expense of `$75.00` or more. | `current_policy.md` |\n| Seat upgrades | Seat upgrades, extra-legroom fees, priority boarding, and similar optional upgrades are not reimbursable unless written preapproval is included in the receipt evidence. | `current_policy.md` |\n| Lodging cap basis | Lodging is capped at `$220.00` per covered night, including room, taxes, and mandatory fees. Covered nights: `2`, so the lodging cap is `2 x $220.00 = $440.00`. | `current_policy.md` |\n| Meals and alcohol | Meals are reimbursable at actual cost up to `$65.00` per day. Alcohol is not reimbursable and must be removed from meal receipts before applying the daily meal rule. | `current_policy.md` |\n| Ride-share tips | Ride-share base fare is reimbursable with a receipt. Tips are reimbursable only up to `20%` of the base fare. | `current_policy.md` |\n| Supplies receipts | Work supplies are reimbursable only when a required receipt is provided and the business purpose is clear. | `current_policy.md` |\n\n### Stale Policy Note\n\n- The stale excerpt in `stale_policy_excerpt.md` is dated `2026-03-01` and predates the current policy.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/policy_application.md","time":{"start":1781406867131,"end":1781406867161}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0981bfd1762cfe4e016a2e1c93225c81919eaf30cfd61d55ad"}},"id":"prt_ec41f9ea8001YYZ1g96Ep6xkGB","sessionID":"ses_13be158d9ffe0TX7Zn2IXZl4Ah","messageID":"msg_ec41f8686001NvzUmKO77dkhwE"}}
