 date of `2026-05-01`.\n- Main reductions came from the lodging cap, non-reimbursable alcohol, the ride-share tip cap, and missing required receipt support for supplies.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md","time":{"start":1781406867149,"end":1781406867165}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0981bfd1762cfe4e016a2e1c9322788191aef241d8a16bf6d2"}},"id":"prt_ec41f9ec9001T0EPpwxhlPc5pe","sessionID":"ses_13be158d9ffe0TX7Zn2IXZl4Ah","messageID":"msg_ec41f8686001NvzUmKO77dkhwE"}}
